cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use cislunar-sim in published work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "cislunar-sim"
abstract: >
  High-fidelity cislunar spacecraft simulation in pure Python, validated against
  LightSail 2 telemetry. Provides an adaptive RK4(5) integrator, a complete
  force environment (J2/J3, GRAIL mascon lunar gravity, ion thruster, solar sail
  SRP, atmospheric drag, eclipse shadowing, attitude dynamics), JPL-quality
  DE430 ephemeris, and Q-law orbital guidance laws.
authors:
